<pre class=metadata>
Revision: 5.0
Title: DASH-IF IOP v5 Part 6: Content Protection and Security
Status: LD
Repository: Dash-Industry-Forum/IOPv5
Shortname: iop-v5-part6
URL: https://dashif.org/Guidelines/iop-v5/part06-content-protection.html
Group: dashif
Editor: DASH-IF Technical Working Group
Abstract: Content protection and security guidelines for encrypted CMAF/DASH content, DRM signalling, interoperable license request workflows, and DASH-IF content-protection extensions, migrated from the DASH-IF Guidelines-Security Bikeshed source into the IOP v5 part structure.

!Issue Tracking: <a href="https://github.com/Dash-Industry-Forum/IOPv5/issues?q=is%3Aopen+project%3ADash-Industry-Forum%2F32" target="_blank">Currently open Part 6 issues</a><br><a href="https://github.com/Dash-Industry-Forum/IOPv5/issues/new?title=%5BPart+6%5D%3A+" target="_blank">File a new Part 6 issue</a> (then assign to <a href="https://github.com/orgs/Dash-Industry-Forum/projects/32" target="_blank">Part 6 project</a>)
!Document Status: <strong>Working Draft 0.1</strong>.<br><small>See <a href="https://dashif.org/Guidelines/iop-v5/part01-overview.html#document-status">Annex A: Document Status</a> for versioning and workflow.</small>
!Contributors: Contributors are maintained via GitHub pull requests to the <a href="https://github.com/Dash-Industry-Forum/IOPv5">IOPv5 repository</a>.
!Contributing: See <a href="https://dashif.org/Guidelines/iop-v5/part01-overview.html#contributing">Part 1 §1.4 Contributing and Reviewing</a>.
!Key Words: Content Protection, Security, CENC, DRM, Encryption
</pre>

